&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;Key takeaway:&lt;/strong&gt; Don't choose a library because it's popular. Choose an architectural approach that matches your needs:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Need simplicity? → Controlled&lt;/li&gt;
